"value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T21:51:27-08:00","id":1497161,"title":"","content":"Feels like bait, theirs been pretty solid LGBTQ representation for years in transformers now and a gender fluid dude in 2019, by the articles own admission. Its a nice thing but it's actually pretty part of the coarse for the franchise now so is more of a footnote than breaking ground. But kotaku is gonna kotaku.<br /> <br /> Personally I always interpreted shockwave as non binary in a alien robot sort of way. But that's more my spin than cannon. Then again transformers reproduce asexually and have limited gender signifyers so it's debatable if their gender is pure performative with no biological aspects at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 11-15-2022, 06:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-16T08:18:32-08:00","id":1497284,"title":"","content":"I always assumed that gender is a fairly new concept for them, something that they picked up only after arriving on Earth. They tend to default to &quot;He&quot; and &quot;Him&quot; when using gendered languages like English, but I always imagined that their original language on Cybertron didn't have gender concepts. Everyone was just equally robots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-17T14:25:40-08:00","id":1497417,"title":"","content":"I do remember that in Spotlight Arcee that genders were a new thing in Transformers IDW lore when it discovered that Jihxaxus forced a change in the species. But I also remember we had female Autobots in the old G1 series and Shockwave commenting that he thought they were all gone and in Beast Wars we had female Maximals &amp; Predacons galore..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-14T23:31:16-08:00","id":1499723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1497147-transformers-have-gender-identity-now-\ud83c\udf08?p=1497417#post1497417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do remember that in Spotlight Arcee that genders were a new thing in Transformers IDW lore when it discovered that Jihxaxus forced a change in the species. But I also remember we had female Autobots in the old G1 series and Shockwave commenting that he thought they were all gone and in Beast Wars we had female Maximals &amp; Predacons galore..</div> </div> </div> </div>Transformers reproduce asexually so the reasons for gender tend to vary from edition. In the cartoon its a byproduct of their origins as commercial products wereas in the idw comics tries to graft it on using contemporary thoughts on gender (with mixed results imo). <br /> <br /> I always liked the idea as it being a cosmetic option appropriated from organics and us projecting our norms onto it. Arcee is a woman because humans percieve her or the female seeker slipstream consciously chose to model herself that way for personal reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-15T11:27:17-08:00","id":1499769,"title":"","content":"I'm curious which comic company will get the rights to Transformers now and I hope that it won't be updated for a &quot;Modern Audience&quot; trope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-15T12:58:14-08:00","id":1499778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1497147-transformers-have-gender-identity-now-\ud83c\udf08?p=1499769#post1499769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious which comic company will get the rights to Transformers now and I hope that it won't be updated for a &quot;Modern Audience&quot; trope.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh they already did that. Idw did a series where they leaned hard into it. Thankfully they actually did a good job for a change so it went well.<br /> <br /> The closest they came to screwing up is transgender transformers since firstly could lean into some cruel comments and the conundrum of how possible it is to replicate such a human issue with genderless alien robots but even then it went OK and didn't go &quot;very special episode.&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 12-15-2022, 04:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T13:29:38-08:00","id":1499890,"title":"","content":"I heard IDW was going under and they lost the rights to Transformers and other properties or did I hear it wrong? I had heard reports about IDW no longer having the rights to the Transformers last year or so and there was speculation that folks like Robert Kirkman might be interested in it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}